    "detailed_description": "Sip'it is a varied drinking game that should not be missing at any party. It's every man for himself!<br>You can play with 9 other players on your computer.<br><br>You are able to <strong>complete various tasks</strong>, talk about your <strong>secrets </strong>and <strong>prove your skills</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to play?</h2>The game is played on a board game, with a dice you decide how far you can go and what task awaits you.<br>Depending on which field you land on, you can expect: <i>Truth, Dare, Topics, Do or Drink and other Tasks</i>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Often the same players?</h2>You have the option to create presets for your fellow players to speed up the start of the game!<br>So every name, gender and color of the player is adopted directly.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customizable options:</h2>Are you missing questions, tasks or topics?<br>No problem - you can design this individually according to your wishes at any time.<br>You can create new ones, delete old ones or change them completely.<br>You can also adjust the number of sips at your discretion.<br><br>Please drink responsibly.<br><br>This game is for entertainment purposes only.",
